{"id": "dic-01", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Open the report and check whether the figures match the appendix.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-02", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Search for related work was conducted in IEEE Xplore and the ACM Digital Library.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-03", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Close collaboration with the supervisor is essential for the thesis.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-04", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Type I errors were controlled using the Holm correction.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-05", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Press releases from the university were also analysed.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-06", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Stop words were removed before computing the similarity.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-07", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Copy editing will be done after the second draft.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-08", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Run the analysis again with the corrected data set.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-09", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Pasta is the most popular dish among the participants.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-10", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Jarvis is the assistant in the Iron Man films.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-11", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Minimize the cognitive load by reducing the number of steps.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-12", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Switch to the second condition after the break.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-13", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Mute participants could not complete the voice condition.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-14", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Go back to the previous section and rewrite the introduction.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-15", "split": "dictation", "lang": "en", "text": "Scroll down to the results to see the latency distribution.", "route": "dictation"}
{"id": "dic-16", "split": "dictation", "lang": "el", "text": "Άνοιξε το παράθυρο γιατί κάνει ζέστη στην αίθουσα.", "route": "dictation"}
